Origin
------

This project started in January 2025 from the Magic Portfolio template by the
Once UI team (https://github.com/once-ui-system/magic-portfolio), licensed
CC BY-SA 4.0. That template's code was removed over the course of the 2026
rebuild — the design system, components, configuration, styles and content
model in this repository were all written from scratch — and no file from it
remains in the current tree. Earlier commits in this repository's history do
still contain it, and this notice is the attribution for that.
